  "scope": [
    "Unified target KV reservation entry; removed its redundant optional argument and repeated caller-side calculation.",
    "Merged single-row/batched Top-K encoding and decoding kernels while retaining their distinct CUB sorting algorithms and deterministic tie order; removed unused numeric header.",
    "Vector cache trim retained for aligned layouts; scalar fallback added for other positive BF16 widths. RoPE and prefill AttentionValues iterate over all coordinates instead of stopping at launch block size.",
    "Indexer keeps the optimized 16-head path and arbitrary-head fallback; validates its documented 128-element quantization block layout instead of silently misinterpreting another width.",
    "Grouped NVFP4 Marlin small-batch routing reserves for both grouped and one-padded-block-per-route layouts, including reuse after earlier smaller requests. No model-name, expert-count or hidden-size special case added."
  ],
